<section vertical-align="center">
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item>
      <h2>Three leadership choices unlock the next quarter</h2>
      <p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative decision asks — not company data.</b> <b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p>
      <grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="fill">
        <grid-item colspan="20" cell-style="subtle">
          <labels><label variant="solid">Approve</label></labels>
          <h3>Fund the onboarding intervention</h3>
          <p>Invest <b>$0.4M</b> in an onboarding pod to address the adoption constraint.</p>
          <hr color="neutral-border"/>
          <h4>Modeled outcome</h4>
          <p><span text-color="palette-2"><b>18 to 14 days</b></span> and <span text-color="palette-2"><b>1 point of retention recovery</b></span>.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="20" cell-style="subtle">
          <labels><label variant="solid">Approve</label></labels>
          <h3>Protect price discipline</h3>
          <p>Set a <b>12% discount guardrail</b>, with CFO exceptions, to close the visible margin leak.</p>
          <hr color="neutral-border"/>
          <h4>Modeled outcome</h4>
          <p><span text-color="palette-2"><b>0.3 margin points protected.</b></span></p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="20" cell-style="subtle">
          <labels><label variant="solid">Confirm</label></labels>
          <h3>Rebalance commercial capacity</h3>
          <p>Redirect <b>two open commercial roles</b> from acquisition to expansion coverage.</p>
          <hr color="neutral-border"/>
          <h4>Driver addressed</h4>
          <p>Make customer expansion—not acquisition—the next unit of commercial capacity.</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>